{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_54","type":"agent_message","text":"I reproduced an initial cursor timeout on Jupiter. The JVM adapter has an ordering race: http-kit sends the 101 response before `on-open` installs the receive adapter, so a frame can arrive and be dropped in that gap. I’ve moved adapter setup before the handshake and added a JVM regression test for that ordering."}}
