{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_127","type":"agent_message","text":"Committed `7060af65` on `feat/p3prime-descriptor-cljpy`. The commit is unpushed.\n\nThe root cause predates P3′ and the `2e7ded4a` reconciliation. In the original JVM WebSocket adapter from `71a1dc5c`, http-kit sent `101 Switching Protocols` before `on-open` installed the receive adapter. The old `on-message` at `src/clj/dao/stream/ws/jvm.clj:320` silently dropped frames that arrived in that window.\n\nOn Jupiter, a trace with no added delay caught the merged JVM peer dropping both the descriptor probe and the cursor request during a Transit corpus timeout. Pausing adapter setup in the pre-P3 JVM peer reproduced the exact `str-1` Transit failure. Detached runs at `7be4e2da`, `fd148fd9`, `f765cd58`, and `2e7ded4a` each passed all 579 tests. The reconciliation and merged master have identical trees. The laptop lane passed before and after the fix.\n\nThe fix installs the JVM receive adapter before sending the `101` and sends any early server close after the handshake. The new JVM regression test failed on pre-P3 and passed with the fix. The original cross-node fixture stayed intact. [JVM adapter](/Users/sto/workspace/dw-p3prime/src/clj/dao/stream/ws/jvm.clj:299) · [Regression test](/Users/sto/workspace/dw-p3prime/test/dao/stream/ws/jvm_test.clj:484)\n\n| Verification on `7060af65` | Result |\n|---|---:|\n| `bb test:sub:cljs dao.stream` on Jupiter and laptop | 579 tests / 4,898 assertions each |\n| Focused cross-node reruns on Jupiter | 3 of 3 passed |\n| Python ANTLR and core REPL | 74 / 469 |\n| Descriptor, catalog, and query | 44 / 549 |\n| Clojure, callsite, and effect | 160 / 1,677 |\n| Wedge | 1 / 7 |\n| JVM WebSocket and live REPL serving | 48 / 233 |\n| `analyze-deps` | Zero cycles or multi-namespace SCCs |\n\nAll verification runs in the table had zero failures and errors."}}
